    "citation": "GEOS-CF aqc_tavg_1hr_g1440x721_v1, surface model layer index 72 (not 72 hPa). Cairo cell lat 480, lon 845 (30.04°N, 31.24°E). Up to four hours each year (12:30Z on 15 Jan, Apr, Jul, Oct). A failed request is omitted, not filled, so a year can be a mean of fewer than four hours. The annual figure is the mean of the hours that returned, q estimated, not a full-year mean and not a regional mean. PM2.5 is pm25_rh35_gcc in µg/m³. Gases are dry-air volume mixing ratio converted at 25 °C and 1013.25 hPa (µg/m³ = ppbv × MW / 24.465). Modeled, not a station measurement, not an AQI. 1e15 is missing and was dropped. Knowland et al., GMAO Office Note 17.",
